<title>USA: TENNIS-AT&amp;T CHALLENGE SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AT&amp;T CHALLENGE SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $328,000 AT&amp;T</p>
<p>Challenge men's clay court tennis tournament on Saturday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Semifinals</p>
<p>Marcelo Filippini (Uruguay) beat 8-Chris Woodruff (U.S.) 7-5</p>
<p>3-6 6-4</p>
<p>7-Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) v Magnus Norman (Sweden)</p>
</text>
